{"ts":"2026-08-30T17:19:09.784Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"gpt-5.6-sol","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"c99208c34c90f379f9997cef","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-5.6-sol","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-30T17:19:09.784Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-30T17:19:09.784Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Ported the committed pm-ops publish-attestation verifier and shell scanner; wired `verify:release-publish-attestation` into both `release:check` and the named CI step. Dedicated regression tests cover heredoc bodies, discarded bindings, multiline continuations, subshells, uninvoked functions, and child-scope assignment leakage.\n\nEvidence:\n- `npm run verify:release-publish-attestation`: passed, reporting exactly `.github/workflows/release.yml: 1 publish invocation(s), each carrying --provenance`.\n- Non-vacuity probe `npm publish --access public --ignore-scripts`: exited 1 and named the unattested command; removing it returned the gate to green.\n- Revert proof with the previously absent verifier module: the new regression suite exited 1 with `ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND`.\n- Focused c8 run over the three new modules: 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; 79 tests passed.\n- `npm run lint`, `npm run duplicates`, and `npm run docstring`: passed; docstring gate reports 39 files and 213 declarations documented.\n"}]}],"before_hash":"7f14796d18be28369d3a05d3e7704aa42a14bbed2ef90642baa7eaafde89ca96","after_hash":"6ce00779b5eadb01040c9c23ae3774097a9a8f40ff3ef6a6669e87826e650521","item_hash_version":2}
